cactus-needle (this npm package) is an independent browser and Node.js wrapper for Needle 3.
It is not an official Cactus Compute package.

The unmodified files vendor/needle.js, vendor/needle.wasm, and vendor/needle.h
are from Cactus Compute's Cactus-Compute/needle3 repository on Hugging Face,
revision 2ae11323dc000f5e70c49f7403efa6af12ba9e67.
They are distributed under Apache License 2.0; see vendor/LICENSE.
Source URLs and SHA-256 checksums are recorded in vendor/manifest.json.
vendor/package.json and vendor/manifest.json are supplied by this wrapper.

dist/browser/worker.js includes a modified copy of the upstream JavaScript
loader: Node.js branches are removed and its export is adapted to browser ESM.
These changes are performed by build/needle-runtime.ts. The WASM binary is unchanged.

Model weights are downloaded separately from the same upstream repository
and are not included in the npm package. Its Apache License 2.0 also applies
when redistributing those weights.
